    {
      "id": "zn7DnTTJbt9yw2Cp-aH23",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2465.347495363334,
      "y": 210.16232505622463,
      "width": 540.8475341796875,
      "height": 660,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1680767068,
      "version": 252,
      "versionNonce": 1914823260,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1751776409413,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Database Schema: \n\n1. ImmediateRequest\n\n- Id\n- payload\n- authId\n- createdTime\n- updatedTime\n- status\n- requestType\n\n\n2. ScheduleReq\n- Id \n- type\n- scheduletime \n- payload\n- requestType\n- created, updated\n\n3. Execution. // require the action execution,  req : execution ( 1: m )\n with  ttl\n- scheduleReqId, immediateReqId\n- executionId\n- timestamp\n- status\n\n4. plan\n- time // minute\n- status.\n- id\n- creted time",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Database Schema: \n\n1. ImmediateRequest\n\n- Id\n- payload\n- authId\n- createdTime\n- updatedTime\n- status\n- requestType\n\n\n2. ScheduleReq\n- Id \n- type\n- scheduletime \n- payload\n- requestType\n- created, updated\n\n3. Execution. // require the action execution,  req : execution ( 1: m )\n with  ttl\n- scheduleReqId, immediateReqId\n- executionId\n- timestamp\n- status\n\n4. plan\n- time // minute\n- status.\n- id\n- creted time",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zHnmlj5Vd8ZsSzdEJOSDK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1563.7050979680719,
      "y": -187.51532859654174,
      "width": 895.7113037109375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 376850020,
      "version": 936,
      "versionNonce": 632080612,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1751776412542,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flows: \n- Immediate Notification ( notifiy this user)\n  1. Domain service will call apito notification system -> user , text: \"hello world\" -> payload of api. \n  2. notfication -> saving this in notfication request db and return id to domain. \n  3. it will emit events to pipe. \n  4.  execution planner will receive this and it will se its immediate, it will make entry in exectuion.\n  5. publish this event to pipeline for execution. \n  6. segregation will be going to pick and see its of message type and send to the pipe of that worker.\n  7. worker is customised for messaging android messaging, it will see the details in payload and also connect with \n     integration service to get the crendetial and other details and going to call the 3rd party.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flows: \n- Immediate Notification ( notifiy this user)\n  1. Domain service will call apito notification system -> user , text: \"hello world\" -> payload of api. \n  2. notfication -> saving this in notfication request db and return id to domain. \n  3. it will emit events to pipe. \n  4.  execution planner will receive this and it will se its immediate, it will make entry in exectuion.\n  5. publish this event to pipeline for execution. \n  6. segregation will be going to pick and see its of message type and send to the pipe of that worker.\n  7. worker is customised for messaging android messaging, it will see the details in payload and also connect with \n     integration service to get the crendetial and other details and going to call the 3rd party.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fju8MUqVXfmQ6nQlVfKGG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1561.533043257654,
      "y": 68.36450898655562,
      "width": 976.6229248046875,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1609215460,
      "version": 2122,
      "versionNonce": 1735067620,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751778574482,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flows: \n- Schedule and recurring Notification ( notifiy this user)\n  1. Domain service will call apito notification system -> user , text: \"hello world\" -> payload of api with future time. \n  2. notfication -> saving this in schedule request db and return id to domain. \n  3. it will emit events to pipe, need to be executed in next 1 minutes. \n  4.  execution planner will receive this and it will convery in minutes -> 1:00 -> 1:01 -> reduce to 1. and put in execution db.\n  5. cronjob would be running -> periodic and it will pick events from every minute and push in pipeline for segregator\n  6. segregation will be going to pick and see its of message type and send to the pipe of that worker.\n  7. worker is customised for messaging android messaging, it will see its shedule type, it will pick all execution in that minute\n    and going to executed them.\n\nin case of recurreding, scheduler will pick events of the recurring too, and put in execution table.\n\n\nDatabase:  \n - if we see , we kind of have fixed structure,\n - and we see, we can have ttl for old data\n   and can be push to some database or s3 or cold db.\n - we want consistency, and can use MYSQL. \n - regarding scale -> we can use ttl and size will be less and indexes. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flows: \n- Schedule and recurring Notification ( notifiy this user)\n  1. Domain service will call apito notification system -> user , text: \"hello world\" -> payload of api with future time. \n  2. notfication -> saving this in schedule request db and return id to domain. \n  3. it will emit events to pipe, need to be executed in next 1 minutes. \n  4.  execution planner will receive this and it will convery in minutes -> 1:00 -> 1:01 -> reduce to 1. and put in execution db.\n  5. cronjob would be running -> periodic and it will pick events from every minute and push in pipeline for segregator\n  6. segregation will be going to pick and see its of message type and send to the pipe of that worker.\n  7. worker is customised for messaging android messaging, it will see its shedule type, it will pick all execution in that minute\n    and going to executed them.\n\nin case of recurreding, scheduler will pick events of the recurring too, and put in execution table.\n\n\nDatabase:  \n - if we see , we kind of have fixed structure,\n - and we see, we can have ttl for old data\n   and can be push to some database or s3 or cold db.\n - we want consistency, and can use MYSQL. \n - regarding scale -> we can use ttl and size will be less and indexes. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Idpv44GX3SfWTyr7UWPy7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1119.6288829198008,
      "y": -1080.9374548875605,
      "width": 62.60532512191344,
      "height": 29.785612453989973,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
