    {
      "id": "sUPn8cDftMpcejGD7XbL0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1577.0595442613596,
      "y": 567.1683476853724,
      "width": 592.54345703125,
      "height": 260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1373644132,
      "version": 815,
      "versionNonce": 706811620,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1751778576676,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scaling: \n    - how to scale scheduler that will run for each minutes.\n    - Solutions: \n            - normally scale -> race conditions and problem in concurrency.\n              - temporary lock -> let run multiple instance\n              - lock the row let say with status column.\n              - so that when other will pick it will pick which are not started.\n            - shard the requests -> run the schedule for equivalent to shard.\n              we can plan shard as per future requests. \n            - each schedule will be different instance, with k8s , gauranteeing \n              atmost one pod will be running. \n\n  ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scaling: \n    - how to scale scheduler that will run for each minutes.\n    - Solutions: \n            - normally scale -> race conditions and problem in concurrency.\n              - temporary lock -> let run multiple instance\n              - lock the row let say with status column.\n              - so that when other will pick it will pick which are not started.\n            - shard the requests -> run the schedule for equivalent to shard.\n              we can plan shard as per future requests. \n            - each schedule will be different instance, with k8s , gauranteeing \n              atmost one pod will be running. \n\n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
